{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "6d5d4ca4e5a10ac48b8b1031126016cd98901792e41ec63e93450d9348498493", "ja": "あら、{$P$}じゃない。\nどうしたの？", "zh": "哎呀，这不是{$P$}吗。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4836fd8062c8899d911c3b094f98b1b08c865bb26b249ee24831c5292003314a", "ja": "ああ、忘れ物を取りに寄ったんだけど……\nごめん、今取り込み中だったか？", "zh": "啊，我是回来拿落下的东西……抱歉，你刚才是不是正忙着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "648ba8b2613c37dcd5af8125e36f3c15c3993d12ff6abcf89877d34e94e15d2f", "ja": "そうね、女の子のメイク直し中に入ってくるなんて、\nちょっと気遣いが足りないんじゃない？", "zh": "是啊，女孩子正在补妆的时候闯进来，是不是有点不够体贴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4ce23a7c8f1d01e7448de2e5496aceae3924b5b5f6e13ae87c9d1b346c6fb06a", "ja": "……悪い、すぐに出ていくから、\nそこの資料だけ取らせてくれ……！", "zh": "……不好意思，我马上就出去，\n只要拿一下那边的资料就好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "c9e0d32b32ad1f1c6d91be52b9d06d225c714357b66daa0d69de495adf972fab", "ja": "なーんて、冗談よ。\nもう終わったところだから、別にいいわ。", "zh": "什么的，开个玩笑啦。\n我已经忙完了，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c7bc4c2865c52e853ba01aa1f769ab9d103dbae6f215f10259aba51fdcb6dfbb", "ja": "そうか、よかった……。……ん？\n伊織のその服、初めて見たな。最近買ったのか？", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……。……嗯？\n伊织那身衣服，我还是第一次见到。最近买的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "44c4a764d9ee204dd2ea0831a32d64aa3f9b5713b4ddd47bde23f0e7a5c44174", "ja": "あら、アンタにしてはよく気づいたじゃない♪\nどう、似合ってるでしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，没想到你还挺会观察的嘛♪\n怎么样，很适合我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "569f0edc5800325c47d8aae598ef8d192e5b3c8cbdf8b83d9ff925497947be5d", "ja": "ああ。上品だけど、かわいらしさもあって……\nさすが伊織、私服のセンスもバッチリだな！", "zh": "嗯。既优雅又不失可爱……\n不愧是伊织，连便服的品味也很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "e6d4f26ff53b44f0c2e91fb5cf5cb747b7f9fc22a3b2387fe5016546a1d3b75c", "ja": "当然……って言いたいところだけど、\n実はこの服、私が選んだものじゃないの。", "zh": "那是当然……我本来想这么说啦，\n但其实这身衣服，并不是我挑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "35ae4f3bb861822703ac4dfb9f2ccf69e5846d1e580db71496486416a7becd7e", "ja": "この間、やよいたちと買い物に行った時、\nみんなが選んでくれたのよ。", "zh": "前段时间和弥生她们去买东西时，是大家帮我选的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "313afcc49d1b864c6178ddac46eef77f8a84fb453176488c170abf1062b37650", "ja": "髪型のアレンジまで、服にあわせて考えてくれて……\nふふっ、なかなか楽しかったわ♪", "zh": "连发型的搭配都配合衣服一起考虑了……呵呵，还挺开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3971e659295753d6ea8b7b81fc8977111da8825a4074543c75f08f2754517c6f", "ja": "へえ、髪型まで。確かに、伊織のことをよくわかってる\nコーディネートって感じだな。", "zh": "哦，连发型都考虑到了。确实是很了解伊织的搭配啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "74da95562adf440d5ddf59e5d934ea4c6d6d40d633db4c8b19385a38b40feca7", "ja": "そうよね、私もすごく気に入ってるの。楽しみな予定が\nあるときは、ついこれを選んじゃうくらいにはね♪", "zh": "就是嘛，我也特别喜欢。每当有令人期待的安排时，就会不由自主地选它呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c0b7abfacfebf9143a998b0a0adcc4dcdb98120f2bd5b583de966b983c3aa05f", "ja": "と、いうことは……\nこのあと、何か楽しみな予定でもあるのか？", "zh": "也就是说……\n接下来是有什么值得期待的安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "692a017a9b31c8d822023f9b6d20fed7a22eb18d12ebac443313b0e18fa1601d", "ja": "ええ。また同じメンバーで買い物に行くの♪\n今度は私が服を選んであげようと思って。", "zh": "嗯。我们还会和同样的成员一起去买东西♪\n这次我想帮她们挑衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fee1cc3fd24f5d6eb862fc349ba0515a7cd5e9fa951e18f4ef8dd3083ae4eec4", "ja": "それは楽しみだな。しかし……\nアイドル同士で私服を選びあう……か……。", "zh": "那可真让人期待。不过……\n偶像们互相挑选便服……吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "cf81bc6e9c9c5616d8e72a16e53b0987267c5f5292e04c2129c216955479b3b3", "ja": "……ねえ、ちょっとアンタ、\n何か変なこと考えてるんじゃないでしょうね？", "zh": "……喂，我说你啊，\n该不会在想什么奇怪的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "dce0911879a4af664f2e447bdb77bf7e2c3a25684398f035654d293033ecc9dc", "ja": "い、いやいや、何かいい企画になりそうだなと\n思ったら、つい頭が仕事モードに……。", "zh": "不、不不，只是觉得好像能策划出什么不错的企划，一不小心就进入工作模式了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "536a60452afabcefb10870b0e7bf02ccf8abbfd431898274bb92463d707fe511", "ja": "企画？　なんかあやしいわね……。でもまぁ、\n荷物持ちなら、買い物に同行させてあげてもいいわよ？", "zh": "企划？总觉得有点可疑呢……不过嘛，要是帮我提东西的话，倒是可以让你陪我一起去买东西哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1019_p", "source_sha256": "629ac441b6e27c37ea11625fa06469f18a17893997184e235af0145fc4a9559e", "ja": "はは……魅力的なお誘いだが、ほかの仕事もあるし、\n今回は遠慮しておくよ。みんなで楽しんできてくれ。", "zh": "哈哈……虽然这个邀请很诱人，但我还有其他工作要做，\n这次就算了。你们好好玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0334_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "fd9fe0f0e945d7c00206b2d22671bd82fec490a8236534918dcb3a5b9290c434", "ja": "あらそう？　ま、気が向いたらアンタに差し入れでも\n買ってきてあげるわ。それじゃ、行ってくるわね♪", "zh": "这样啊？嘛，要是心情好，我就顺便给你\n买点慰劳品回来吧。那我走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
